## Context

Child of tracking ticket 0251. Ticket 0220 (PR #304) renamed
`start-ticket` → `hunt`, leaving `skills/start-ticket/SKILL.md` as a
15-line muscle-memory stub that announces the rename and delegates to
`/hunt`. The author ratified removing it: with the rename a month old,
the stub is a dead entry point and the consolidation's goal is fewer
entry points.

## Relevant files
- `skills/start-ticket/SKILL.md` — the stub to delete
- `README.md` — auto-generated skills catalog (regenerate)

## Actions
1. Delete `skills/start-ticket/` entirely.
2. Run `make skills-catalog` to regenerate the README catalog.
3. Sweep the repo for remaining `start-ticket` references (skills, docs,
   scripts, tests) and update or remove them — full-logical-unit sweep,
   one commit.

## Test
- `make check-skills-drift` passes; no `start-ticket` reference survives
  outside historical material (closed tickets, docs/ archives, git log).

## Verification
- [ ] `skills/start-ticket/` gone; catalog regenerated
- [ ] `grep -r start-ticket` clean outside historical material

## Invariants
- `/hunt` untouched
- `make check` passes

